        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人民日报金句—清正廉洁篇</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 20px;\n    background: #e8e8e8;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 700px;\n    background: #fdfdfb;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    padding-bottom: 30px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    background: #3a3a3a;\n    color: #ddd;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .topbar .dots {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .topbar .dots span {\n    width: 8px;\n    height: 8px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(1){background:#4fc3f7;}\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(2){background:#81c784;}\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(3){background:#ba68c8;}\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(4){background:#ffb74d;}\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(5){background:#e57373;}\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(6){background:#4dd0e1;}\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(7){background:#f06292;}\n  .topbar .dots span:nth-child(8){background:#aed581;}\n\n  .header-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    padding: 18px 30px 10px 30px;\n  }\n  .title-box {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: #f2f2ef;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 6px 20px 6px 6px;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n  }\n  .title-badge {\n    background: #2b3a55;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    margin-right: 12px;\n  }\n  .title-text {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    color: #222;\n  }\n  .date-box {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    background: #f2f2ef;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    padding: 5px 16px;\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .date-icon {\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n    border: 1.5px solid #333;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    margin-right: 8px;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .date-icon::before {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: -4px;\n    left: 2px;\n    width: 1.5px;\n    height: 4px;\n    background: #333;\n    box-shadow: 7px 0 0 #333;\n  }\n\n  .content-area {\n    position: relative;\n    margin: 0 30px;\n    padding: 10px 20px 10px 40px;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(\n      to bottom,\n      transparent 0,\n      transparent 31px,\n      #d9e4ea 32px\n    );\n    background-size: 100% 32px;\n  }\n  .margin-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 20px;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #e8a3a3;\n  }\n\n  .item {\n    display: flex;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 32px;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    margin-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n  .item .num {\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .item .txt {\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .hl {\n    background: #f6d3d8;\n    border: 1px solid #d9524f;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    padding: 0 2px;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n  }\n\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 10px;\n    top: 90px;\n    bottom: 60px;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 26px;\n    color: rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n    letter-spacing: 6px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .credit {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 10px;\n    bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #aaa;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <span>Notes / Contents</span>\n    <div class=\"dots\">\n      <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n      <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"header-row\">\n    <div class=\"title-box\">\n      <span class=\"title-badge\">Title</span>\n      <span class=\"title-text\">人民日报金句—清正廉洁篇</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"date-box\">\n      <span class=\"date-icon\"></span>\n      <span>05.30</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">学而成德 · 惠小红书</div>\n\n  <div class=\"content-area\">\n    <div class=\"margin-line\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">1、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">心在正中，不存邪念，是为\"忠\"；言而能成，不搞虚假，用为\"诚\"。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">2、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">要从一开始就好扣好人生的扣子，常怀<span class=\"hl\">感恩之心、敬畏之心、律己之心</span>，常用真善美来雕琢自己，在清廉自守中正心修身、矢志图强。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">3、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">要树立\"君子固穷\"的清正意识，以<span class=\"hl\">澄江静如练</span>的淡泊与坦然除去心灵的\"杂草\"；要拧弄养尊处优的<span class=\"hl\">小九九</span>，摒弃徇私谋利的<span class=\"hl\">小山头</span>。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">4、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">要涵养廉洁自律的道德修为，<span class=\"hl\">心有所畏、言有所戒、行有所止</span>，不断锤炼意志力、坚忍力、自制力，做一个<span class=\"hl\">一心为公、一身正气、一尘不染</span>的人。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">5、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">青年干部要扣好人生第一粒扣子，坚持吾日三省，在思想上<span class=\"hl\">多照\"镜子\"</span>、勤清洗\"灰尘\"、去除\"杂质\"自觉同上级要求\"对标\"，拿党章党规\"扫描\"，用人民期待\"透视\"。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">6、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">\"尽小者大，慎微者著\"，青年干部要牢记\"堤溃蚁孔，气泄针芒\"的古训，从日常点滴做起，从一言一行做起。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">7、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">要常怀敬畏之心，自觉防微杜渐，<span class=\"hl\">远离\"高压线\"、不逾\"红线\"、坚守\"底线\"</span>，把家风建设摆在重要位置，持之以恒<span class=\"hl\">净化\"生活圈、交往圈、娱乐圈\"</span>。</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"item\">\n      <span class=\"num\">8、</span>\n      <span class=\"txt\">欲知平直，则必准绳；欲知方圆，则必规矩。无以规矩不成方圆，纪律是衡量D员干部行为的尺子，把纪律当作耳旁风然必然要付出代价。</span>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"credit\">Designed by Ilzzzl</div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
